ss=\"p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">May Áo Khoác</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Sản xuất áo khoác Bomber, Varsity Jacket, Hoodie nỉ bông 380gsm, áo khoác dù 2 lớp chống nước và chần bông mùa đông.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Vải dù kháng nước, lót lưới/lụa cao cấp</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Bo cổ &amp; tay áo dệt sọc độc quyền</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Khóa kéo kim loại, nút bấm mạ bóng</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 pt-0\"><a href=\"/dich-vu#ao-khoac\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 cursor-pointer w-full bg-transparent text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 active:translate-y-0.5 text-xs px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl gap-1.5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider \"><span>XEM CHI TIẾT &amp; BÁO GIÁ</span></a></div></article><article class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-200 hover:border-blue-900 hover:shadow-md group\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Gia Công Local Brand\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558769132-cb1aea458c5e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\"><div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center font-bold uppercase tracking-wider border shadow-xs bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 border-amber-400 font-black text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg gap-1.5 \"><span>Trọn 