-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-snug\">Bảo Mật 100% Mẫu (NDA)</h3><span class=\"text-&#91;10px&#93; font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 border border-blue-200\">Cam kết</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Cam kết bằng văn bản không rò rỉ rập thiết kế hay bán mẫu độc quyền.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors group\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5 text-blue-900\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\"><h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-snug\">Tiến Độ Chuẩn Xác 98%</h3><span class=\"text-&#91;10px&#93; font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 border border-blue-200\">Đúng hẹn</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Bồi thường 1%/ngày nếu chậm tiến độ so với lịch launching cam kết.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors group\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers w-5 h-5 text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"tru