y-2.5 text-xs rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-900\" type=\"email\" value=\"\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5\"><label class=\"block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-slate-700\">Ghi chú chi tiết yêu cầu bổ sung:</label><textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Mô tả cụ thể về vị trí in, kích thước hình in, tiến độ cần giao hàng gấp...\" class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 text-xs rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-900\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"pt-2\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 cursor-pointer w-full bg-blue-900 text-white hover:bg-blue-800 border border-blue-900 shadow-sm active:translate-y-0.5 text-sm px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl gap-2.5 font-black uppercase tracking-widest min-h-&#91;48px&#93; \" type=\"submit\"><span>XÁC NHẬN GỬI YÊU CẦU BÁO GIÁ NHANH</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-send w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z\"></path><path d=\"m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939\"></path></svg></button></div></form></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-14 sm:py-18 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 \" id=\"faq-section\"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--3\"]\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full \"><div class=\"flex flex-col max-w-3xl space-y-2.5 text-center items-center mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-&#91;11px&#93; font-bold uppercase tr